"Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们在情形<REF_0001>下工作，即<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），<MATH_0002>是一个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），由<MATH_0003>－代数（algebras）构成。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n对任意<MATH_0004>，拉回（pullback）<MATH_0005>是一个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），由<MATH_0006>－代数（algebras）构成。我们将考虑二元组<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>是概形之间的一个态射（morphism），这里的对象为概形（schemes），而<MATH_0009>是一个态射（morphism），在<MATH_0010>－代数（algebras）之间。注意，这等价于给出一个<MATH_0011>－代数同态（algebra homomorphism）<MATH_0012>，见《层（Sheaves）》中的引理<REF_0002>。这也等价于给出一个<MATH_0013>－代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0014>，见《层（Sheaves）》中的引理<REF_0003>。我们将使用理解<MATH_0015>的这三种方式，不再另行说明。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n给定这样的二元组<MATH_0016>和一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0017>，我们得到另一个二元组<MATH_0018>，称之为<MATH_0019>的拉回（pullback）。描述<MATH_0020>的一种方式是将它写成如下复合（composition）\n<MATH_0021>\n其中第二个映射（map）是<MATH_0022>，这里<MATH_0023>。这样，我们就定义了一个函子（functor）\n<MATHSEG_0001>二元组<MATHSEG_0002>如上所述<MATHSEG_0003>\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:f3b79fa9b8fef721bedf962ea9d7e26a20b2fad0398e9a70a1c0d1a0166ddb0c", "unit_id": "tag:01LQ:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所处情形中的基概形", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "所处情形中给定的代数层", "source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"context": "给定的拟凝聚层的代数结构", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "给定层的拉回", "source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"context": "拉回所得的代数层", "source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"context": "拉回所得拟凝聚层的代数结构", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "二元组中的概形态射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "二元组中第一个态射的源和靶", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "二元组中的代数态射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "二元组中第二个态射的源和靶", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "给出代数态射的第一种等价描述", "source_term": "algebra homomorphism", "target_term": "代数同态"}, {"context": "支持第一种等价描述的引理所在章节", "source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "给出代数态射的另一种等价描述", "source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"context": "支持另一种等价描述的引理所在章节", "source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "用来拉回所给二元组的态射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "由所给二元组和态射得到的二元组", "source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"context": "描述拉回所得二元组中代数态射的复合", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"context": "该复合中的第二个映射", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "由二元组及其拉回给出的函子", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}]}
